strengths.value:
— Proposed representation is more efficient compared to regular latent grids and is comparable to surface latent grids (3DILG) in terms of latents needed to represent shape; 
— Method figure is clear and well done and quantitative results are well formatted;
— Qualitative results look comparable to NGLOD which is a strong baseline for shape overfitting setting;
— Design choices are clearly ablated (Table 4);

